@startuml use_case_diagram

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "GitHub Workflow Manager" {

  package "Interactive Mode — Runs" {
    usecase "Launch interactive menu"  as UI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as I_ADD
    usecase "List all runs"            as I_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as I_DETAIL
    usecase "Advanced filter runs"     as I_FILTER
    usecase "Query workflow state"     as I_QUERY
  }

  package "Interactive Mode — Attempts" {
    usecase "Add workflow attempt"     as I_AADD
    usecase "List all attempts"        as I_ALIST
    usecase "Get attempt detail"       as I_ADETAIL
    usecase "Advanced filter attempts" as I_AFILTER
    usecase "Query attempt state"      as I_AQUERY
  }

  package "Run Filters (Interactive/CLI)" {
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as FCONCL
    usecase "Filter by duration"       as FDURATION
    usecase "Filter by timestamp"      as FTIMESTAMP
    usecase "Filter by attempts"       as FATTEMPTS
  }

  package "Attempt Filters (Interactive/CLI)" {
    usecase "Filter by run ID"         as AFRUN
    usecase "Filter by status"         as AFSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as AFCONCL
    usecase "Filter by duration"       as AFDURATION
    usecase "Filter by timestamp"      as AFTIMESTAMP
  }

  package "Utilities" {
    usecase "Parse datetime with TZ"   as TZPARSE
    usecase "Convert to UTC"           as TZKOTC
    usecase "Format for display"       as TZFMT
  }

  package "Command-line Mode" {
    usecase "Run one-shot CLI command" as CLI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as C_ADD
    usecase "List runs (with filters)" as C_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as C_DETAIL
    usecase "Query workflow state"     as C_QUERY
    usecase "Manage attempts"          as C_ATTEMPT
  }
}

User --> UI
User --> CLI

UI --> I_ADD
UI --> I_LIST
UI --> I_DETAIL
UI --> I_FILTER
UI --> I_QUERY
UI --> I_AADD
UI --> I_ALIST
UI --> I_ADETAIL
UI --> I_AFILTER
UI --> I_AQUERY

I_FILTER --> FBRANCH  : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> FSTATUS  : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> FCONCL   : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> FDURATION : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> FTIMESTAMP : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> FATTEMPTS : <<extend>>

I_AFILTER --> AFRUN : <<extend>>
I_AFILTER --> AFSTATUS : <<extend>>
I_AFILTER --> AFCONCL : <<extend>>
I_AFILTER --> AFDURATION : <<extend>>
I_AFILTER --> AFTIMESTAMP : <<extend>>

I_FILTER --> TZPARSE : <<uses>>
I_AFILTER --> TZPARSE : <<uses>>

CLI --> C_ADD
CLI --> C_LIST
CLI --> C_DETAIL
CLI --> C_QUERY
CLI --> C_ATTEMPT

C_LIST --> FBRANCH : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> FSTATUS : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> FCONCL : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> FDURATION : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> FTIMESTAMP : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> FATTEMPTS : <<extend>>

C_LIST --> TZPARSE : <<uses>>

@enduml
